      "content": "10k is still a lot lower than we planned for, and if the press finds out we're running low right at the start, the stock price is gonna take a hit. It'll look like we botched the rollout. Is there any way we can frame this better? Like, instead of saying we're short on stock, could we position this as a deliberate move to keep it exclusive or something? I need to know how to sell this so it doesn't look like a failure.",
